8. REFLECTIONS & LESSONS LEARNED
   Uur idea was solid and integrated our world interests in cybersecurity and mixed it with a real need within healthcare.
   Therapist's prespectives on their need for digital tools and secure workflows is not commonly vocalized but this project helped us 
   identify a problem and practice implementing a solution that advocated for their needs. It is definitely an underrated topic that 
   not a lot of people are aware of. While this does target workers in the healthcare industry, SecureNotes could also serve well as a 
   stand alone app for the average person who needs a local form of secure note taking. With more time, we would expand the 
   capabilities of the app and research how security features are implemented in java codebases in general.
